        <section id="about" class="mb-16 scroll-mt-16 md:mb-24 lg:mb-36 lg:scroll-mt-24" aria-label="About me">
          <div class="sticky top-0 z-20 -mx-6 mb-4 w-screen bg-slate-900/75 px-6 py-5 backdrop-blur md:-mx-12 md:px-12 lg:sr-only lg:relative lg:top-auto lg:mx-auto lg:w-full lg:px-0 lg:py-0 lg:opacity-0">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-200 lg:sr-only">About</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mb-4">
            I'm a senior iOS engineer who ships. Over the last 6 years I've taken 16 apps
            from first commit to the App Store, owning the full native layer: architecture,
            Swift, SwiftUI, and UIKit, Objective-C in legacy codebases, Core Data, release
            pipelines, and App Store review.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            My work spans <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/foqos/id6736793117" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Screen Time and Family Controls</a>,
            <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/peptify-peptide-tracker/id6760272148" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">HealthKit</a> with
            <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/focus-bear/id1673296334" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">motion and fitness tracking</a> on
            Apple Watch, <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://athanify.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">StoreKit 2 subscriptions and paywall infrastructure</a>,
            fintech and payments across <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id6444354321" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Apple Pay, Stripe, and Tap to Pay</a>,
            <a class="font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:text-teal-300" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hiiker-the-hiking-maps-app/id1470810597" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">maps with offline tile caching</a>,
